# 统一换行符策略：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按操作系统自动转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本在检出时需要 CRLF，否则无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件，禁止任何转换与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.db binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
